title: "Decadic Cycle Cognitive Architecture"
abstract: >-
  An embodied, non-LLM cognitive architecture implementing the Decadic Cycle of
  Expression: a ten-stage cognitive loop with predictive-coding learning,
  pain/pleasure viability, episodic and semantic memory, and a stage 3->4
  attention gate.
type: software
